# v1.0.2

## English

### Highlights

- **Viewport Culling** — Subtitle list items and timeline track segments are now culled when outside the visible viewport, significantly reducing rendering work when scrolling through long timelines or large subtitle lists.

### Improvements

- **Viewport culling for timeline segments**: segments outside the visible area are no longer rendered (previously all segments were rendered regardless of scroll position), improving performance on long timelines
- **Viewport culling for subtitle list items**: same optimization applied to the subtitle/transcription list, only items in view are rendered
- **Subtitle correction area**: fixed height calculation and text vertical alignment in the correction region

### Bug Fixes

- **Subtitle correction area layout**: corrected the height computation of the correction region and the vertical alignment of its text

---

## 简体中文

### 亮点

- **视口裁剪** — 字幕列表项与时间轴轨道片段在超出可视区域时不再渲染，滚动浏览长时间轴或大字幕列表时显著降低渲染负担。

### 优化

- **时间轴片段视口裁剪**：视口外的片段不再渲染（原来无论滚动位置都会渲染全部片段），长时间轴下性能提升明显
- **字幕列表视口裁剪**：字幕/转录列表采用同样的优化，仅渲染可视范围内的条目
- **字幕 correction 区域**：修正区域高度计算与文字垂直对齐

### Bug 修复

- **字幕 correction 区域布局**：修复 correction 区域高度计算错误与文字垂直对齐问题
